      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/15/msa@/~cl_16__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “licensee, licensed operator or terminal licensee” di mana-mana jua terdapat dengan perkataan “licensee, licensed operator, terminal licensee or intermediation business licensee”. Pindaan seksyen 199"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/15/msa@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 199 Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “satu ribu ringgit” perkataan “atau dipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi tiga bulan atau kedua-duanya”. Pindaan seksyen 200"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/15/msa@/~cl_18",
